From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:15:50 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add Live Teacher: AI English voice teacher (feature branch,
 not for main yet)

Real-time voice lessons (OpenAI Realtime over WebRTC) with a strict,
bilingual teacher personality, server-side mistake tracking
(new / repeated / relapse / mastered, 4-step tone ladder), CEFR level
estimate, pronunciation and vocabulary memory, and three modes
(normal, strict, exam).

- base44/functions/liveTeacherApi + shared/liveTeacher{Core,Prompt,Engine}.js
- entities LiveTeacherProfile / LiveTeacherLesson (added to the wipe map)
- /live-teacher page and WebRTC client; permanent OpenAI key stays server-side
- tools/live-teacher-tests: 25 offline tests + a real-model scenario runner
- docs/live-teacher.md: setup, privacy, and what is not verified yet

Not run against the real OpenAI API or built with npm (no network here).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
